Text: "Definition-like groups declare interfaces, define or realize values,
refine types, state reusable propositions, and configure their requirements,
capabilities, aliases, documentation, and justifications. These pages spell out
the distinct roles and exact ordered sections of `Declares:`, `Defines:`,
`Realizes:`, `Refines:`, `States:`, and `Disambiguates:`."
Id: "4bcdb923-37c3-434e-8891-cb3cc3dd45f3"
